      "text": "[4:40PM] #Apongbon #EkoBridge #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is on the high side coming in from Broad street inwards Apongbon underneath the bridge inwards the Market and ascending the Eko Bridge.\n\nTraffic on the Marina/CMS Bridge inwards Apongbon is also on the high side.\n\nThe high volume of traffic is due to the increased number of vehicles plying this route as result of the maintenance of the expansion joints on the Ifako bridge.\n\nPatience is key as you are assured that our Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is safe and seamless for us all.\n\n@Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
